    {
      "post_id": "544411313779126272",
      "text": "TEN news has received a video in which a #lindtcafe hostage relays the gunman's demands. At police request we will not broadcast it.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 08:39:06 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544470861952983040",
      "text": "Just the demands...no need to exaggerate. Not everything there's too much, my head would explode. @LoL_Ailias @hughriminton @Colvinius",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 12:35:43 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4446934364850586e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544454308255657984",
      "text": "@hughriminton @Colvinius @Cherylkarma They have being saying \"NO\" since ... 12ish? Maybe 3ish? It's not a cuppa tea and a bikkie!",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 11:29:57 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444389786030121e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544412147900379137",
      "text": "@hughriminton @SharriMarkson Can't put the toothpaste back into the tube @hughriminton . You've already released details. #MartinPlace",
